QuestGuidance.Register("en",123,{
[3905]="70072FDA\n1\tCollect birêt-kibur (total: 12)\tThe Temámir believe the minerals found in shooting stars that have crashed to the earth can be forged into potent weapons and tools. They will be grateful for the continued recovery of such fine material.\n2\tBring the birêt-kibur to Gôbezhir Firmhand\tThe Temámir believe the minerals found in shooting stars that have crashed to the earth can be forged into potent weapons and tools. They will be grateful for the continued recovery of such fine material. Deliver the birêt-kibur to Gôbezhir at Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[3906]="70072FD0\n1\tCollect bowls of nakhód júra (total: 8)\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Craft nakhód júra for delivery to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.\n2\tDeliver nakhód júra to Lejâl, at Zajâna\tKighân's recovery requires not only the sword, but also the plowshare. Assist the people by attending to more mundane efforts across the land. Deliver crafted nakhód júra to the Steward of Mûr Ghala, Lejâl, at Zajâna.\n",
[3907]="70072FD9\n1\tCollect sarláshi branches at Zakûr (total: 6)\tThe Temámir, having seen the recovery of sarláshi wood from the ancient Kinta grove in An Shêru, seek more of the sturdy wood to work into their crafts. They would be pleased if some were collected and returned.\n2\tBring the sarláshi branches to Gôbezhir Firmhand\tThe Temámir, having seen the recovery of sarláshi wood from the ancient Kinta grove in An Shêru, seek more of the sturdy wood to work into their crafts. They would be pleased if some were collected and returned. Deliver the sarláshi wood to Gôbezhir at Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[3908]="70072F7A\n1\tDefeat sword-wielding Orcs at Fushaum Sûlm in Adagím (total: 20)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. The Orcs of Fushaum Sûlm are an incursion force from far to the west. They capture scouts, steal vital weaponry, and have set up a camp in Adagím. Defeat Orcs at Fushaum Sûlm.\n",
[3909]="70072FD1\n1\tCollect a satchel of unpolished gems near Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tThe Temámir dwarves of Jiret-menêsh collect crystals from the surface, polish them finely, and send them below to their elders for light and more within their ancient halls. Assist them if you will. Clean and polish crystals for Semísi at Jiret-menêsh.\n2\tPolish crystals from the unpolished crystal satchel (total: 5)\tThe Temámir dwarves of Jiret-menêsh collect crystals from the surface, polish them finely, and send them below to their elders for light and more within their ancient halls. Assist them if you will. Deliver polished crystals and the satchel to Semanísi.\n3\tBring the satchel and polished gems to Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh\tThe Temámir dwarves of Jiret-menêsh collect crystals from the surface, polish them finely, and send them below to their elders for light and more within their ancient halls. Assist them if you will. Deliver the polished crystals to Semanísi at Jiret-menêsh.\n",
[3910]="70072F80\n1\tRecover stolen treasure from Ordâkhai sorcerers at Jag Golód (total: 10)\030Recover Pohâni writings from sword- and bow-wielding Ordâkhai at Jag Golód (total: 10)\tKighân stirs to recovery. They seek whatever aid they can find to aid their freedom, reclamation, and continued growth. Aid the people to receive adoration and favour throughout Mûr Ghala. Recover treasure and writing from the Ordâkhai at Jag Golód in Kighân.\n",
[3911]="70072FD8\n1\tClear moss away from the tombs near Jag Golód (total: 6)\tFell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead. Clear moss and clean the tombs near Jag Golód.\n2\tClean the tombs near Jag Golód in Kighân (total: 6)\tFell magic has long plagued the lands of Kighân. With the restoration at hand, the people desire to rid the fell things that disturb their dead. Help them pay respects and purge the Restless Dead. Clear moss and clean the tombs near Jag Golód.\n",
[3912]="70072FD7\n1\tPlace torches near the crypt entrances (total: 9)\tThe forsaken land of An Shêru wakens, but the hold of evil upon the land remains. Assist the people of An Shêru and all of Mûr Ghala will benefit. Restore the torches near the crypts.\n",
[3913]="70072F76\n1\tCheck cocoons for captives in the Cloakwood (total: 6)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Spiders in the Cloakwood are deadly foes from ancient times. They prey upon scouts, breed unchecked, and spread the blight across Nisigím. Check for captives trapped in cocoons within the Cloakwood.\n",
[3914]="70072FC1\n1\tDestroy grodbog hives (total: 10)\030Defeat gredbyg in Gnasher's Delf (total: 12)\tIt is not only Men who stole treasures, lives, and lore from the people of Idâgal. Eaters of the dead, the sky-tamers, and the vile gredbyg, all contribute to the land's ills. You should defeat gredbyg and destroy grodbog hives at Gnasher's Delf.\n",
[3915]="70072FC3\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai in Emax Dûl (total: 15)\tHorrors across Idagâl, be they of the mind and stirred spirits or, the physical pain wrought by man, should be addressed for the betterment of Mûr Ghala. You should defeat the Ordâkhai in Emax Dûl.\n",
[3916]="70072F75\n1\tDefeat Baltmau Overseers at Fushaum Sûlm ([see journal]/1)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. The Orcs of Fushaum Sûlm are an incursion force from far to the west. They capture scouts, steal vital weaponry, and have set up a camp in Adagím. Defeat an Overseer at Fushaum Sûlm.\n2\tEnemies abound in Adagím. The Orcs of Fushaum Sûlm are an incursion force from far to the west. They capture scouts, steal vital weaponry, and have set up a camp in Adagím. Rescue scouts from Fushaum Sûlm.\t\n",
[3917]="70072F7F\n1\tDefeat sword-wielding Ordâkhai at Jag Golód in Kighân (total: 12)\tKighân stirs to recovery. They seek whatever aid they can find to aid their freedom, reclamation, and continued growth. Aid the people to receive adoration and favour throughout Mûr Ghala. Defeat Ordâkhai at Jag Golód in Kighân.\n",
[3918]="70072F7C\n1\tDestroy mushrooms in the Mires of Moth Thúruch (total: 12)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Bramble trolls in the Mires of Moth Thúruch spread the blight. The Kintai need assistance in destroying this enemy, the fungus they nurture, and identifying what malice they spread. Destroy blight-mushrooms at Moth Thúruch.\n",
[3919]="70072F74\n1\tDefeat bramble trolls in the Mires of Moth Thúruch (total: 16)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Bramble trolls in the Mires of Moth Thúruch spread the blight. The Kintai need assistance in destroying this enemy, the fungus they nurture, and identifying what malice they spread. Defeat blight-trolls at Moth Thúruch.\n",
[3920]="70072FDC\n1\tCollect bunches of blue thistle at Jag Golód (total: 6)\030Collected bunches of amaranth at Jag Golód (total: 6)\030Collect bunches of foxglove at Jag Golód (total: 6)\tKighân stirs to recovery. They seek whatever aid they can find to aid their freedom, reclamation, and continued growth. Aid the people to receive adoration and favour throughout Mûr Ghala. Collect herbs for medicinal cures from Jag Golód.\n2\tDeliver the blue thistles, amaranth, and foxglove to Lejâl at Zajâna\tKighân stirs to recovery. They seek whatever aid they can find to aid their freedom, reclamation, and continued growth. Aid the people to receive adoration and favour throughout Mûr Ghala. Deliver the herbs for medicinal cures from Jag Golód to Lejâl at Zajâna.\n",
[3921]="70072FC2\n1\tCollect Zajâni-made keys (total: 8)\tThe scholars of Zajâna seek to recover all remnants of their history taken by the invaders who oppressed them. They ask for assistance in making delicate tinctures and sturdy keys to recover their lost knowledge. Create and deliver Zajâni-made keys to Lejâl at Zajâna.\n2\tDeliver Zajâni-made keys to Lejâl at Zajâna\tThe scholars of Zajâna seek to recover all remnants of their history taken by the invaders who oppressed them. They ask for assistance in making delicate tinctures and sturdy keys to recover their lost knowledge. Create and deliver Zajâni-made keys to Lejâl at Zajâna.\n",
[3922]="70072F73\n1\tDefeat a bow-wielding Orc at Fushaum Sûlm\tEnemies abound in Adagím. The Orcs of Fushaum Sûlm are an incursion force from far to the west. They capture scouts, steal vital weaponry, and have set up a camp in Adagím. Defeat a bow-wielding Orc at Fushaum Sûlm.\n2\tRecover arrows stolen by the Orcs at Fushaum Sûlm (total: 24)\030Defeat bow-wielding Orcs at Fushaum Sûlm ([see journal]/10)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. The Orcs of Fushaum Sûlm are an incursion force from far to the west. They capture scouts, steal vital weaponry, and have set up a camp in Adagím. Collect arrows from bow-wielding Orcs at Fushaum Sûlm.\n",
[3923]="70072F78\n1\tDefeat spiders within the Cloakwood in Adagím (total: 20)\tEnemies abound in Adagím. Spiders in The Cloakwood are deadly foes from ancient times. They prey upon scouts, breed unchecked, and spread the blight across Nisigím. Defeat spiders at the Cloakwood.\n",
