[3926]="70009D54\n1\tWait for the hobbit dance-celebration to begin\tThe Dance Leader is under the Party Tree in the Shire. Wait for the hobbit dance-celebration to begin and follow the instructions of the Dance Leader.\n2\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n4\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n7\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n11\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by