[3927]="70009D55\n1\tWait for the dance-celebration of Men to begin\tThe Dance Leader is in the centre of the Bree Festival Grounds. Wait for the dance-celebration of Men to begin and follow the instructions of the Dance Leader.\n2\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n4\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n7\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tTake a brief rest\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader.\n11\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n12\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n13\tFollow the Leader's dance steps before time runs out\tFollow the dance steps called out by the Dance Leader. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n14\tTalk to Ada Musgrove\tThe Dance Leader is in the centre of the Bree Festival Grounds. Having completed the dance-steps required, speak to the Dance Leader to learn the dance of Men.\n",
[3928]="7000A13A\n1\tDefeat sand-lurkers (total: 5)\tSand-lurkers can be found throughout the Barandalf, but especially at Lithost, south-east of the Colossus, on the other side of the river from the ruins of Barad Tharsír. Herthdúr has asked you to defeat some of the sand-lurkers that make travel through the Barandalf dangerous for him and his inventory of goods.\n2\tTalk to Herthdúr at the colossus camp\tHerthdúr is at the Ranger-camp at the colossus, north-west of the Barandalf. You have put an end to some of the sand-lurkers that prowl among the dunes of the Barandalf and should report of your success to Herthdúr.\n",
[3929]="700331C4\n1\tDefeat enemies atop Khadar-zarâm (total: 8)\tEnemies can be found on the highest levels of Khadar-zarâm in Nud-melek. You should defeat enemies that wait upon the stair to waylay innocent travellers.\n2\tReturn to Svanr\tSvanr can be found at the foot of the great stair in western Nud-melek. You should return to Svanr and tell him that you have cleared out many enemies within Khadar-zarâm.\n",
[3930]="700377D6\n1\tTalk to Ordgar\tOrdgar can be found near the gates into Entwade. Thane Edric has asked that you speak to his guards inside and near the river Entwash to learn of any news of the Enemy's whereabouts in Kingstead.\n2\tTalk to Inguc\tInguc can be found slightly to the south-east outside the gates of Entwade. You have spoken to Ordgar. You should continue to speak to Thane Edric's guards in hopes of discovering why the attacks have ceased in the past week.\n3\tTalk to Anrad\tAnrad can be found slightly to the north outside the gates of Entwade. You have spoken to Inguc of more threats in Kingstead. You should speak to Anrad before returning to Thane Edric.\n4\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found near the waggons outside the Mead Hall of Entwade. You have spoken to Edric's men and learned much of the threats facing Kingstead. You should now return to Thane Edric.\n",
[3931]="70020DA5\n1\tReturn to the site of the first footprint\tThe footprint you found lies to the west of Echad Idhrenfair. Himeinior has asked you to return to the site of the footprint you found and track the beast to its lair.\n2\tFind the second footprint\tThe second footprint lies to the south of the first, which was to the west of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue to track the beast to its lair.\n3\tFind the third footprint\tThe third footprint lies to the west of the second, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.\n4\tFind the fourth footprint\tThe fourth footprint lies to the west of the third, south and west of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.\n5\tFind the fifth footprint\tThe fifth footprint lies to the south-west of the fourth. You should continue tracking the beast to its lair.\n6\tEnter the Grey King's lair and defeat the creature\tThe creature's lair lies to the north-west of the fifth footprint, south-west of Echad Idhrenfair. Himeinior bade you defeat the unknown creature.\n7\tTalk to Himeinior at Echad Idhrenfair\tHimeinior is at Echad Idhrenfair, north-east of the Grey King's lair. You have defeated the creature known as the Grey King and should return to Himeinior with news of your victory.\n",
[3932]="70041242\n1\tExplore to the west of Artamir's camp\030Explore to the north-west of Artamir's camp\030Explore to the north of Artamir's camp\030Find the entrance to the Orc camp\tArtamir has asked you to investigate a number of different locations in the Dead Marshes, seeking some clue to the Orkish presence here. He asked you to seek out notable spots to the north, north-west, and west, and said he would do the same.\n2\tTalk to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes\tYou have found some interesting spots within the Dead Marshes, but few clues to the Orkish presence here. You should return now to Artamir's camp. Perhaps he found something of note.\n",
[3933]="70003444\n1\tDefeat rampaging bristlehides (total: 10)\tThe boars can be found near Constable Bolger's house, south-east of Staddle, south of Widow Froghorn's farm. Constable Tanglerush wants you to thin the boar population near Staddle before one of the hobbits is attacked.\n2\tTalk to Constable Tanglerush\tConstable Tanglerush is in the town square of Staddle. Constable Tanglerush will be pleased to hear that you have thinned the boar population near Staddle.\n",
[3934]="7004CE3B\n1\tDestroy Taurog-dens (total: 10)\tTaurog-dens can be found in Tholkát, in northern Eryn Lasgalen. You should destroy Taurog-dens in Tholkát.\n2\tTalk to Thorlind\tThorlind can be found near Tholkát. You should talk to Thorlind.\n",
[3935]="7005AAAF\n1\tDefeat kergrim in the Pit of Stonejaws (total: 10)\tKergrim can be found throughout the Pit of Stonejaws.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig near Akhaldarâg\tKyrstig is scouting near Akhaldarâg.\n",
[3936]="7000B954\n1\tTim Strawley drove his waggon south of Echad Candelleth along the road heading for Hollin, which crosses a small ford east of Garbert's cottage and climbs towards the Hollin Ridge. Tongannel has asked you to follow the road south and search for any sign of Tim Strawley to allay her fears for his safety.\t\n",
})
